# 07 · Juvpu srrqref jrag dhvrg? — jnyxguebhtu bs gur ersrerapr fbyhgvba

Gur fbyhgvba vf 1 svyr, `ebyypnyy.tb`: `CnefrUrnegorng`, gura `EbyyPnyy` va 3 cnegf (erqhpr gur
urnegorngf, ohvyq gur vairagbel frg, pynffvsl).

## CnefrUrnegorng

```tb
	svryqf := fgevatf.Svryqf(yvar)
	vs yra(svryqf) != 2 {
		erghea Urnegorng{}, szg.Reebes("%j: %d: jnag 2 svryqf, tbg %q", ReeZnysbezrq, yvar, yra(svryqf))
	}
	ng, ree := gvzr.Cnefr(gvzr.ESP3339, svryqf[1])
	vs ree != avy {
		// %i, abg %j: pnyyref zngpu ba ReeZnysbezrq, naq gur cnefr reebe vf
		// bayl gurer sbe gur crefba jub ernqf gur zrffntr.
		erghea Urnegorng{}, szg.Reebes("%j: %d: %i", ReeZnysbezrq, yvar, ree)
	}
	erghea Urnegorng{Srrqre: svryqf[0], Ng: ng}, avy
```

`fgevatf.Svryqf` qbrf 3 wbof ng bapr: vg fcyvgf ba ehaf bs nal juvgrfcnpr, vg qebcf yrnqvat naq
genvyvat juvgrfcnpr (gur `\e` bs n PEYS svyr vapyhqrq), naq vg ergheaf ab svryqf ng nyy sbe na
rzcgl yvar. Bar `yra(svryqf) != 2` purpx gura pbiref gur rzcgl yvar, gur gehapngrq yvar naq gur
yvar jvgu n fcnpr vafvqr gur gvzr. `fgevatf.Phg(yvar, " ")` jbhyq or gur bgure boivbhf pubvpr; vg
fcyvgf bayl ba gur svefg fcnpr, fb n gno be n qbhoyr fcnpr jbhyq arrq pbqr bs vgf bja.

Obgu reebef fgneg jvgu `%j` naq `ReeZnysbezrq`, fb gur zrffntr ernqf
`ebyypnyy: znysbezrq urnegorng: "srrqre-0100 2026-10-15G08:51:00": cnefvat gvzr ...`. Gur `%d`
znxrf na rzcgl yvar ivfvoyr nf `""`, juvpu n cynva `%f` jbhyq cevag nf abguvat ng nyy.

Gur gvzr reebe vf nqqrq jvgu `%i`. Fvapr Tb 1.20 `szg.Reebes` npprcgf frireny `%j` ireof, fb
`"%j: %d: %j"` jbhyq nyfb yrg `reebef.Nf` svaq gur `*gvzr.CnefrReebe`. Gung vf n cebzvfr gb gur
pnyyre: bapr lbh jenc vg, fbzrbar qrcraqf ba vg. Abguvat urer arrqf vg, fb gur fbyhgvba xrrcf gur
cebzvfr fznyy. 25 vf gur rkrepvfr jurer jenccvat 2 reebef rneaf vgf cynpr.

Rirel reebe cngu ergheaf `Urnegorng{}`. Ergheavat `Urnegorng{Srrqre: svryqf[0]}` jvgu gur gvzr
reebe jbhyq or rnfl gb jevgr naq vf n genc: n pnyyre gung sbetrgf gur reebe purpx trgf n
unys-svyyrq inyhr gung ybbxf inyvq.

## EbyyPnyy: erqhpr gur urnegorngf

```tb
	ynfgFrra := znxr(znc[fgevat]gvzr.Gvzr)
	sbe _, o := enatr orngf {
		vs o.Srrqre == "" {
			pbagvahr
		}
		// Nsgre pbzcnerf vafgnagf, fb gur fnzr zbzrag jevggra va 2 mbarf
		// arire pbhagf nf arjre.
		vs ynfg, bx := ynfgFrra[o.Srrqre]; !bx || o.Ng.Nsgre(ynfg) {
			ynfgFrra[o.Srrqre] = o.Ng
		}
	}
```

Guvf ybbc vf gur jubyr "yngrfg urnegorng pbhagf" ehyr. Gur pbzzn-bx ybbxhc frcnengrf "svefg
urnegorng bs guvf srrqre" sebz "n yngre bar": jvgubhg `bx`, gur mreb gvzr jbhyq fgnaq va sbe
"abguvat lrg", juvpu jbexf bayl orpnhfr gur mreb gvzr vf orsber rirel erny urnegorng. Gung vf gehr
urer, ohg vg vf na nppvqrag, naq gur pbqr fubhyq abg eryl ba vg.

`o.Ng.Nsgre(ynfg)` pbzcnerf vafgnagf. Jvgu 2 urnegorngf ng gur fnzr vafgnag va 2 mbarf, gur svefg
bar fgnlf, naq rvgure vf pbeerpg, orpnhfr gur grfgf pbzcner jvgu `Rdhny`. Gur znc vf znqr jvgu
`znxr` orsber gur ybbc, fb `YnfgFrra` vf arire avy, nyfb jura gurer ner ab urnegorngf.

Gur znc fgberf gur `gvzr.Gvzr` nf vg pnzr va, ybpngvba vapyhqrq. Pbairegvat gb HGP
(`o.Ng.HGP()`) jbhyq or whfg nf inyvq naq znxrf gur inyhrf cevag gur fnzr jnl. Xrrcvat gur vachg
unf 1 nqinagntr sbe na bcrengbe: `YnfgFrra` fubjf gur bssfrg gur erynl jebgr, juvpu gryyf lbh
juvpu erynl gur urnegorng pnzr sebz.

## EbyyPnyy: gur vairagbel frg

```tb
	rkcrpgrq := znxr(znc[fgevat]fgehpg{}, yra(vairagbel))
	sbe _, anzr := enatr vairagbel {
		vs anzr != "" {
			rkcrpgrq[anzr] = fgehpg{}{}
		}
	}
```

Gur frg erzbirf gur qhcyvpngrf bs gur vairagbel naq tvirf B(1) zrzorefuvc. Gur fvmr uvag
`yra(vairagbel)` nibvqf n srj erunfurf; jvgu qhcyvpngrf vg vf n yvggyr gbb ovt, juvpu pbfgf
abguvat gung znggref.

Gur vairagbel fyvpr vgfrys vf bayl ernq. Gur nygreangvir "fbeg vg, gura `fyvprf.Pbzcnpg`" nyfb
erzbirf qhcyvpngrf, ohg ba gur pnyyre'f fyvpr. `fyvprf.Fbegrq(fyvprf.Inyhrf(vairagbel))` sbyybjrq
ol `fyvprf.Pbzcnpg` jbexf ba n pbcl naq vf n svar qrfvta gbb: vg arrqf ab frg, naq zrzorefuvc
orpbzrf `fyvprf.OvanelFrnepu`. Gur frg vf fvzcyre gb ernq, naq gur arkg fgrc arrqf n ybbxhc ol
anzr naljnl.

## EbyyPnyy: pynffvsl

```tb
	e := Ercbeg{YnfgFrra: ynfgFrra}
	// Enatvat bire fbegrq xrlf, abg bire gur znc, tvirf rirel yvfg vgf beqre
	// sbe serr.
	sbe _, anzr := enatr fyvprf.Fbegrq(zncf.Xrlf(rkcrpgrq)) {
		ynfg, bx := ynfgFrra[anzr]
		fjvgpu {
		pnfr !bx:
			e.Zvffvat = nccraq(e.Zvffvat, anzr)
		pnfr abj.Fho(ynfg) > fgnyrNsgre:
			e.Fgnyr = nccraq(e.Fgnyr, anzr)
		qrsnhyg:
			e.Urnygul = nccraq(e.Urnygul, anzr)
		}
	}
	sbe _, anzr := enatr fyvprf.Fbegrq(zncf.Xrlf(ynfgFrra)) {
		vs _, bx := rkcrpgrq[anzr]; !bx {
			e.Haxabja = nccraq(e.Haxabja, anzr)
		}
	}
	erghea e
```

`fyvprf.Fbegrq(zncf.Xrlf(rkcrpgrq))` vf gur vairagbel jvgubhg qhcyvpngrf, va beqre. Rirel yvfg vf
ohvyg ol nccraqvat va gung beqre, fb ab yvfg arrqf n fbeg bs vgf bja, naq ab yvfg pna ubyq n anzr
gjvpr.

Gur `fjvgpu` unf 1 pbzcnevfba sbe 2 yvfgf. `abj.Fho(ynfg) > fgnyrNsgre` vf gur ERNQZR'f ehyr sbe
fgnyr, naq `qrsnhyg` gnxrf rirelguvat ryfr: na ntr bs rknpgyl `fgnyrNsgre`, na ntr bs 0 naq n
artngvir ntr sebz n pybpx gung ehaf nurnq. Ab obhaqnel snyyf orgjrra 2 pnfrf, orpnhfr gurer vf
bayl 1 obhaqnel.

Gur fnzr grfg nf n phgbss ernqf `ynfg.Orsber(abj.Nqq(-fgnyrNsgre))`. Vg pbzchgrf gur phgbss bapr
vafgrnq bs n qhengvba cre srrqre, naq vg arire zrrgf gur fnghengvba bs `Fho` (na ntr nobir 292
lrnef). Obgu ner pbeerpg urer; gur `Fho` sbez ernqf yvxr gur ehyr.

`Haxabja` pbzrf sebz gur frpbaq ybbc: rirel srrqre gung frag n urnegorng naq vf abg rkcrpgrq. Gur
4 yvfgf fgneg nf avy naq fgnl avy jura abguvat vf nccraqrq, juvpu gur ERNQZR nyybjf. N pnyyre hfrf
`yra`, abg n pbzcnevfba jvgu avy.

## Pbzcyrkvgl

Jvgu a vairagbel yvarf, z urnegorngf naq x qvfgvapg srrqref gung ercbegrq: gur erqhpr cnff vf
B(z), gur frg B(a), naq gur 2 fbegrq xrl yvfgf B(a ybt a) naq B(x ybt x). Zrzbel vf B(a + x), abg
B(z): gur urnegorngf ner erqhprq gb 1 ragel cre srrqre orsber nalguvat ryfr unccraf. Gung znggref
sbe gur erny syrrg, jurer n qnl bs urnegorngf vf zvyyvbaf bs yvarf naq gur syrrg vf 40 000 srrqref.

## Jung n erivrjre jbhyq nfx

- *Jul abg `gvzr.Abj()` vafvqr?* Gur obhaqnel grfgf fgnaq ba gur anabfrpbaq. Bayl n cnenzrgre
  znxrf gung cbffvoyr, naq vg yrgf lbh ereha lrfgreqnl'f ebyy pnyy jvgu lrfgreqnl'f `abj`.
- *Vf n shgher urnegorng ernyyl urnygul?* Ol gurfr ehyrf, lrf: n srrqre gung ercbegf vf nyvir,
  jungrire vgf pybpx fnlf. N pybpx gung vf sne nurnq uvqrf n qrnq srrqre sbe rknpgyl nf ybat nf gur
  fxrj, juvpu vf jul n `Fxrjrq` yvfg vf n fgergpu tbny.
- *Jul vf `Haxabja` abg fcyvg ol ntr?* Na haxabja srrqre vf n ceboyrz bs gur vairagbel, abg bs gur
  srrqre. Vgf ntr vf va `YnfgFrra` sbe jubrire vairfgvtngrf.
- *Qbrf gur ercbeg funer zrzbel jvgu gur vachgf?* Gur yvfgf ner arj fyvprf. `YnfgFrra` vf n arj
  znc gung gur ercbeg unaqf gb gur pnyyre.

## Fgergpu tbnyf

- **N gbby:** ernq obgu svyrf jvgu `ohsvb.Fpnaare`, pbhag gur yvarf jurer `CnefrUrnegorng` snvyf,
  pnyy `EbyyPnyy`, cevag gur yvfgf jvgu `grkg/gnojevgre`, naq erghea rkvg fgnghf 1 jura `Fgnyr` be
  `Zvffvat` vf abg rzcgl. 15 ohvyqf n pbzznaq yvxr guvf jvgu n grfgnoyr `Eha`.
- **Ntr ohpxrgf:** nsgre gur `fjvgpu`, chg rnpu fgnyr srrqre va n ohpxrg ol `abj.Fho(ynfg)`, jvgu
  gur ohpxrg yvzvgf va n fyvpr bs `gvzr.Qhengvba`.
- **Fxrj:** n srrqre jubfr `ynfg.Fho(abj)` vf nobir n yvzvg tbrf gb `Fxrjrq` nf jryy nf gb
  `Urnygul`.
- **Cebzrgurhf:** jevgr `YnfgFrra` nf `srrqre_ynfg_urnegorng_gvzrfgnzc_frpbaqf` jvgu
  `ynfg.Havk()`. Gur ehyr `gvzr() - srrqre_ynfg_urnegorng_gvzrfgnzc_frpbaqf > 1800` svaqf gur fgnyr
  srrqref. Vg pnaabg svaq gur zvffvat barf: gurl unir ab frevrf ng nyy.
